
@startuml 用户提交反馈时序图

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #e2f0ff
skinparam noteBorderColor #2d8cf0

actor 普通用户
participant "反馈页面" as UI
participant "FeedbackController" as Controller
participant "FeedbackService" as Service
database "FeedbackMapper" as Mapper
database "数据库" as DB

普通用户 -&gt; UI: 点击缺货反馈
activate UI
UI -&gt; UI: 填写图书ID、图书名称、备注
UI -&gt; 普通用户: 显示表单

普通用户 -&gt; UI: 提交反馈
activate UI
UI -&gt; Controller: POST /feedback/create
activate Controller

Controller -&gt; Controller: 检查用户登录状态

alt 用户未登录
    Controller -&gt; UI: 返回提示请先登录
    UI -&gt; 普通用户: 显示提示信息
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate UI
    stop
end

Controller -&gt; Service: createFeedback(feedback)
activate Service
Service -&gt; Mapper: insert(feedback)
activate Mapper
Mapper -&gt; DB: INSERT INTO feedback
activate DB
DB --&gt; Mapper: 返回插入结果
deactivate DB
Mapper --&gt; Service: 返回影响行数
deactivate Mapper

alt 反馈提交成功
    Service --&gt; Controller: 返回成功
    Controller --&gt; UI: 返回成功信息
    UI -&gt; UI: 显示成功提示
    UI --&gt; 普通用户: 显示提交成功
else 反馈提交失败
    Service --&gt; Controller: 返回失败
    Controller --&gt; UI: 返回失败信息
    UI --&gt; 普通用户: 显示错误信息
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate UI

@enduml
